  <item>
    <title>vol.7 《芭比》的叮叮时刻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64bfd9aee8176c3ff8aaeb67</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64bfd9aee8176c3ff8aaeb67</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 14:18:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上个周日，我们仨加上播客的新朋友小罗，齐聚Pepper的广州家中，斗胆（again）聊了聊观看电影《芭比》之后的感受，话题四处飘散、随机开花，从蔡依林的演唱会，到</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LwzcbOH2DWyDSe1Mgu94pg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LwzcbOH2DWyDSe1Mgu94pg"><span>voguing</span></a><span>的鼓舞力量，再到《芭比》精细幽微的细节捕捉与视听呈现，及其与现实生活中不同性别群体境遇的映照。</span></p><span></span><p><span>观看，感受，思考，表达，交流，碰撞，触发，回响。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们总算鼓起勇气聊了最最最关心却胆怯于当众表达的女性议题。某种意义上，这期节目，也是“縱身一跳”这档播客的纵身一跳时刻。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lktOACgG0bH0M-R5N1lY8AFCe1iv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>(图源小罗：截图自《傲骨之战》）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>好长的时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> Pepper：蔡依林演唱会的启发——女性的行业困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 小罗：voguing舞课上的见闻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 《芭比》电影集中讨论（以下严重剧透预警）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> Clh：为何越看越沉默？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 鸡楼&amp;Pe：clh是隐身家中学多邻国的父亲的化身</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> Clh：男性的break down时刻——从Ken的崩溃说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 关于电影结局的讨论：浅显？温和？——“发现问题”的价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 鸡楼：二刷的时候在电影院做两性观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 小罗：讲述与呈现本身就是一种安慰和疏导</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> 小罗：“过家家”形式的巧妙反拨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 鸡楼：女性中心世界里的男性与男性中心世界里的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2051">34:11</a> 电影中的激进派与现实中的激进力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 鸡楼：保持温和也需要资本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> 凝视Weird Barbie，理解Weird Barbie，成为Weird Barbie</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a> Pepper：“You cannot be a doll.”（职场观察）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2908">48:28</a> 鸡楼：本国度女性面临的双重困境与双向压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3194">53:14</a> 《芭比》是我们的“叮叮”电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a> Clh：关于男性能做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3634">01:00:34</a> Pepper：家庭中的性别赋权——“一家之主”的餐桌见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3729">01:02:09</a> 小罗&amp;Clh：生殖器官的权力象征意涵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3909">1:05:09</a> Pepper：gaybar见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4087">01:08:07</a> Clh：男性的虚伪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4205">01:10:05</a> Pepper：妈妈的可贵变化和爸爸的一成不变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4412">01:13:32</a> 小罗：女性有一种看见的能力&amp;Clh：影片中的温情镜头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4592">01:16:32</a> Clh：上野与黑格尔的启示</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Billie Eillish-《What was I made for?》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Leo王/陈娴静-《得意的一天 A no is a no ft 》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@鸡楼鸡楼、@崔完胜、@pepper_55、@夏鱼壳-</span></p>]]></description>
