  <item>
    <title>vol.4 亲密关系指北：解法没有，问题一堆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f7c6d5eb0492cf2f50873d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62f7c6d5eb0492cf2f50873d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Aug 2022 15:44:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期，我们斗胆聊聊亲密关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pepper回来啦！这一期还请来了我们仨共同的好朋友小谢！撒花欢迎！我们从老友重逢，聊到新朋友间奇妙联结，大厂里的「革命情感」，再到后疫情时代，「情绪」如何成为亲密关系中的关键词，恋爱又是如何变得非必要的……几乎把自己在生活中遇到的亲密关系问题全都摆在了桌面上，尝试用单薄的生命经验以及情感经验，对它们进行抽丝剥茧的剖析……欲知成果如何，听完就知道啦！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1</span></strong><span>：</span><strong><span>「老友记」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 人生假期，适合见老朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="766">12:46</a> 小谢：降低预期的旅行反而更多新奇和快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> Pepper：老朋友的到来帮助我把工作和生活做了很好的切割，让我有了真正意义上的「生活」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">19:17</a> 鸡楼：我不再像以前那样恐惧与朋友的「分离」了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1466">24:26</a> 鸡楼：「都认识这么多年了」不应该成为妥协和将就的前提，而是接近和解决自我问题的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 三观不合，还能继续做朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：「情绪稳定」成了这个时代的必需品</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a> Pepper的大厂人际观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> Clh：好朋友就是要在一起愤世嫉俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> 「以前想谈恋爱，后来喝中药调理好了」</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs0nCI9UX6nbWAumzNUGbZsQrqN2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3228">53:48</a> 「情绪稳定」是他们对伴侣的唯一要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3356">55:56</a> 鸡楼：「麻木」变成了我的节电模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3993">1:06:33</a> 果然人还是会和好朋友谈恋爱呢</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3：总结 （<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5126">1:25:26</a>）&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5215">1:26:55</a> 交流即意义本身</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Smokey Robinson &amp; The Miracles「The Tracks of My Tears」-《The Tears of A Clown》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Michael Giacchino「Up」-《Married Life》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Arooj Aftab「Vulture Prince」-《Mohabbat》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@鸡楼鸡楼、@崔完胜、@pepper_55、@MakiMzx</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>封面灵感 cr: Andrea Ucini</span></strong></p>]]></description>
