  <item>
    <title>vol.3 阅读的意义是，去阅读</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cdb1aa64f141ad81501185</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62cdb1aa64f141ad81501185</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Jul 2022 17:38:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期闲聊，我们随便聊聊，大家随便听听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“阅读”是我们一直想聊的话题，希望这是一期能够缓解焦虑、产生共鸣的分享。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Donny Hathaway「Donny Hathaway Live」-《Jealous Guy》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>陈奕迅「Get A Life 演唱会」-《怕死》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>@鸡楼鸡楼、@崔完胜</span></p>]]></description>
