  <item>
    <title>vol.1 站在人生的分岔路口</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/624d74aed01d114df44b15ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">624d74aed01d114df44b15ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Apr 2022 11:08:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大四的我们未来有了不同的去向，即便关系紧密如我们仨，也开始思考那些与人生的岔路口有关的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为本节目的第一期播客，我们试图通过对近况的审视、对「分岔人生」这个大问题和「纵身一跳 | sleep on it」这个播客名的探讨，开启未来的闲聊之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1：</span></strong><span>近况复盘（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 鸡楼：对于漫漫人生而言，几乎是在一个瞬间就做出了很重要的人生决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> Clh：保研结束，我才回过头系统性地自我审视，追问自己那些大问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> Pepper：对于我来说，能够做出选择的时刻只有当时大三下在淘宝购物车里删去公考教辅、下单考研英语真题的那一刻，在这之后的所有路，就不再是选择，而是必须</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：</span></strong><span>浅谈一下「人生」（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1870">31:10</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 人生真的有岔路口吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> 我们被道路两旁的高墙推挤着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a> 我前所未有地追求一种躺在凹槽里的安全感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3：</span></strong><span>友情「大」讨论（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1905">31:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2696">44:56</a>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1906">31:46</a> 当好朋友走上分岔路后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 脱离应试教育之后，我们开始缔造一种更深度的联结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2571">42:51</a> 我始终期待，在更多样的人生中，与那些曾因际遇分离的好友重逢</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 4：</span></strong><span>关于「纵身一跳 | sleep on it」这个播客名（<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2729">45:29</a>-结束）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 从「云端避难」，到「纵身一跳」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2825">47:05</a> 「sleep on it」，保持敏感，保持思考，允许无力，允许无法给出结论，好好睡一觉，再做决定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 独居的沉默给我时间化钝痛苦，更舒展、更勇敢地张口说话</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Siouxsie and the Banthees「Tinderbox」-《Cities in Dust》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Florence + The Machine 「How Big, How Blue, How Wonderful」-《Hiding》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>主播：@鸡楼鸡楼、@崔完胜、@Pepper_55</span></p>]]></description>
